{"seq":7,"slug":"ai-transformation","title":"AI 转型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/ai-transformation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-robot-intelligence","title":"AI 驱动机器人智能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/ai-transformation/ai-robot-intelligence","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-atlas-evolution","title":"AI 与 Atlas 进化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/ai-transformation/ai-atlas-evolution","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-workforce-impact","title":"AI 对 Boston Dynamics 岗位的冲击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/ai-transformation/ai-workforce-impact","wordCount":1773,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-practice-guide","title":"工程师 AI 实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/boston-dynamics/ai-transformation/ai-practice-guide","wordCount":1920,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# AI 转型\n\n本章深入分析 Boston Dynamics 正在经历的 AI 技术转型——从传统控制工程到 AI 驱动的机器人智能，以及这一变革对岗位、技能要求和职业规划的深远影响。\n\n## 本章内容\n\n- **AI 驱动机器人智能**：大行为模型(LBM)、Google DeepMind 合作、自然语言交互、集群智能\n- **AI 与 Atlas 进化**：从液压到电动、AI 使能的全新能力、量产版规格\n- **AI 对岗位的冲击**：传统控制 vs 学习型方法、新兴岗位、仓储自动化对人工的替代\n- **工程师 AI 实践指南**：学习路径、实践项目、工具生态、行动计划\n"}